      "source": "CDI extension to export Redis repositories. This extension enables Redis\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/Repository.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>Repository</code></a> support. It requires either a <a href=\"../../core/RedisKeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisKeyValueTemplate</code></a> or\na <a href=\"../../core/RedisOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisOperations</code></a> bean. If no <a href=\"../../core/RedisKeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisKeyValueTemplate</code></a> or <a href=\"../../core/RedisKeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisKeyValueAdapter</code></a> are provided by\nthe user, the extension creates own managed beans.",
      "translation": "CDI 扩展用于导出 Redis 存储库。此扩展支持 Redis <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/Repository.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>Repository</code></a>。它需要一个 <a href=\"../../core/RedisKeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisKeyValueTemplate</code></a> 或一个 <a href=\"../../core/RedisOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisOperations</code></a> Bean。如果用户未提供 <a href=\"../../core/RedisKeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisKeyValueTemplate</code></a> 或 <a href=\"../../core/RedisKeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisKeyValueAdapter</code></a>，该扩展将创建其自身管理的 Bean。",
      "count": 1
